[COLOR="DeepSkyBlue"]2.1.5[/COLOR]
[LIST]
[*]Clockwork City.
[*]The status belt will automatically hide itself when you go into Cyrodiil or Imperial City and restore itself to its previous setting when you leave those areas. It is not really needed in those areas as there are no guards and nothing to steal there - and you have more pressing concerns anyway, like hostile players, to worry about there.
[*]Modified the settings saves so that it distinguishes which megaserver you are currently on. This change will require everyone to redo their settings to save them for the megaserver(s) that they play on, but it allows people to play on multiple megaservers without getting the savedvariables corrupted.
